<title>ISRAEL: Israel Aircraft Industries close to $100 mln sale.</title>
<headline>Israel Aircraft Industries close to $100 mln sale.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Israel Aircraft Industries Ltd (IAI) said on Thursday that it was close to signing a $100 million contract with an unnamed European country to supply an airborne early warning system.</p>
<p>&quot;A final agreement will be signed within the next few days,&quot; a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The system will be supplied by IAI's Elta Electronics Industries Ltd subsidiary, a leading producer of air reconnaissance equipment. In the past it has supplied an early warning system to the Chilean air force.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
